WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.372
Rosters ready? Tap "Coin toss".

2
00:00:02.422 --> 00:00:05.020
Put each team on its side: "Switch sides".

3
00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:09.640
The ball marks the first serve: "Switch serve" moves it.

4
00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:15.244
Coach and captain of each team sign: "Sign A" → "Coach".

5
00:00:15.294 --> 00:00:18.588
Sign, then "Save".

6
00:00:18.638 --> 00:00:24.172
Then the captain.

7
00:00:24.222 --> 00:00:29.158
Then "Confirm coin toss result". Missing signatures can follow during the warm-up.

8
00:00:29.208 --> 00:00:31.263
The starting line-ups: tap "Line-up A".

9
00:00:31.313 --> 00:00:38.313
Tap the players in order, position I (the server) first, then "Confirm".

10
00:00:41.117 --> 00:00:44.702
The captain is not on court: tap the "Game captain".

11
00:00:44.752 --> 00:00:51.752
The same for team B.

12
00:00:54.730 --> 00:00:56.481
Tap "Start set".

13
00:00:56.531 --> 00:01:00.098
A reminder: put the libero in if the team has one.

14
00:01:00.148 --> 00:01:03.217
Confirm the start time of the set.

15
00:01:03.267 --> 00:01:06.352
Set 1 is running.
